      "content": "the article i read didnt even mention funding, it was just citing some phd's from top universities who said the math doesnt add up. if the plan is meant to \"integrate\" people, why do all these experts say it's going to drain the social safety net and bankrupt local governments? seems like you're being way too optimistic about the \"mitigation\" part.",
